  Slug: unseen-lizardfolk
  DisplayName: Unseen Lizardfolk
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/ancestry/unseen-lizardfolk.webp
  Description: You can change your skin color to blend in with your surroundings,
    making minor shifts with a single action and dramatic changes over the course
    of an hour. When you're in an area where your coloration is roughly similar to
    the environment (for instance, forest green in a forest), you can use the minor,
    single-action application of this ability to make localized changes that help
    you blend into your surroundings, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to Stealth
    checks until your surroundings change in coloration or pattern.
